WEBVTT

00:18:29.134 --> 00:18:32.582
and finally, John took him
up to the microphone,

00:18:32.606 --> 00:18:35.455
and George said very loudly,

00:18:35.479 --> 00:18:37.899
"Ladies and gentlemen!

00:18:37.923 --> 00:18:40.395
May I have your attention, please?"

00:18:40.419 --> 00:18:42.514
And everyone turned around, startled.

00:18:43.135 --> 00:18:44.446
And George said,

00:18:45.327 --> 00:18:47.207
"I'm glad it's daddy's birthday.

00:18:47.976 --> 00:18:49.713
I'm glad we all get cake.

00:18:51.284 --> 00:18:53.729
And Daddy, if you were little,

00:18:54.312 --> 00:18:55.692
I'd be your friend."

00:18:55.934 --> 00:18:57.084
(Gasp)

00:18:57.958 --> 00:18:59.494
And I thought -- (Applause)

00:18:59.988 --> 00:19:01.139
Thank you.